OL,3,GNEWSARecords tumble at Norwich race -
OL,4,Adespite the hills
OL,5,
OL,6,FClaiming the women's crown was
OL,7,Fdebutante Daisy Glover with a course
OL,8,Frecord of 33 minutes and 26 seconds,
OL,9,Fwhile Cambridgeshire teacher Jonathan
OL,10,FEscalante-Phillips improved his 2024
OL,11,Fmen's record to be the first ever
OL,12,Fcompetitor to finish in under 30
OL,13,Fminutes - at 29:59.
OL,15,FGlover, an NHS worker who runs for
OL,16,FFramlingham Flyers, said: "It was
OL,17,Famazing... literally every corner you
OL,18,Fwent round there were big pockets of
OL,19,Fpeople."
